    "name": "Gym Challenge (Japan)"
  },
  "description": {
    "text": "In 2010 the normal Gym Challenge tournaments of Japan's Official Pokémon Card Gyms went on giving every player one of the eight holo basic Energy cards 011 to 018/L-P at random, and their top three the gold, silver and bronze Pikachu Victory Medals, 033, 032 and 031/L-P, as the official pages list for February, April and August 2010. Beside them the gyms held launch tournaments for Reviving Legends in February, Lost Link in April and Clash at the Summit in July, each with cards of its own, and in August the Summer Vacation Battle Campaign.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Japan Official Pokemon Card Gym Events 2008 - 2009",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/japan-official-pokemon-card-gym-events-2008-2009/"
      },
